<title>Eastern DR Congo: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/drc/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-drc-2026-11-01T16:53:09.761Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sun, 01 Nov 2026 16:53:09 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Joseph Kabila, the former president, has joined rebel forces and is coordinating attacks with the M23 movement against the Congolese government. Rwanda's defence ministry and its military bank Zigama have been sanctioned for supplying M23 and facilitating a gold-smuggling route that funds an Islamic State-linked insurgency in eastern DRC. The FRN reported the capture of several positions in Rugezi after a week of fighting, while two army generals and over 600 soldiers defected to Kabila-led rebels. The conflict caused 1,158 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.euronews.com/2026/10/30/europe-today-rare-oleshky-truce-holds-in-ukraine-albania-imposes-heavy-fines-on-protesters&quot;&gt;Euronews&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXkFVX3lxTE9lWUlWZ29nYmstUnhiaXhNeHFGYmRGbXJZV1JKc3BBMVdvTGlWcFdxRUNpQkR2RTJFSUtmdDdWNzF1RTJrM1VGRVBZOWZJM3c5UWlmMWRVdnBOVjc4d1E?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitAFBVV95cUxNZnU0aGFMeWRjQTBfUHd2ODRWazRkdlZva29rNDdESnZiVldzV2MzUlNWbmthOGtEcGZyZHZCc2RTMmZ2T2kweDF4TkQxRTQ5Z1NEUG04eWExUHpwQ0JEaTVPQWwtQjB0VWZqMG9Pd3BEdDZTSGZYMVU1U0YtV0gwVXR6YXlUZzhfQkEzZjVLZTV5b2tLOUEwS2JWY05rZUZ4Z2tQNzgyQkxMVzhSS012Mkp4ZkE?oc=5&quot;&gt;OCHA&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiWEFVX3lxTE9lQVlaYko2eWdBREJta3FvcHBtaks0UWQtM0VUMnRwZF8xRURtalUxWktXTEFiQzdLdkYweGdvNnN2TXl6NXA0blBpbHNrYWJpUUpSazVLeUY?oc=5&quot;&gt;Israel Defense&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;SMH.com.au&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixAFBVV95cUxNbEtGbWJIS3dZVmQwMndmamRFZi0tZDgyMGpBcUQwMWZVTG5HZWJlYmpCeWFKWlZBWmJhNFI3RkppcW9HZjl0RUVVbkNjUU9EOHhJNnNQVC1EYVFDUHFVQlBjMkd2Y0Q3dDFGd0tfYXJyOGotdW8yYnF1TUtNMTJmb1BUUEVuQWV6b1F